{
 "about": "PSS/E RAW cases compared with PowSyBl, from powsybl-core's tests at a pinned commit (MPL 2.0; the IEEE cases are public test systems, the Illinois synthetic grids are from Texas A&M's ACTIVSg collection). scripts/fetch-reference.mjs downloads them into .cache/reference; they are not copied into the repository. 'start' is the load flow's starting point: 'dc' (DC load flow) or 'raw' (the voltages stored in the file). 'loadflow': false marks a case PowSyBl does not solve (its three-winding data are inconsistent); only its import is compared. 'pending' names what PowerStudio lacks to solve a case as PowSyBl does; its import is compared and its load flow is reported without failing.",
